{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Movies"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Movie Talk"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately explain information interests, hobbies, and preferences in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le03ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Let's Review the Simple Past Tense "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Use the Simple Past tense to talk about:<br /><br /><ol> <li>Finished time. </li> <li>Finished event. </li> <li>Specific time in the past.</li> </ol><br /><span class =\"strong\">Simple Past verb endings  </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add -ed, or -ied to regular verbs to form the Simple Past.<br /><br /><span class=\"italic\">Example:<br />see -- saw<br />take - took<br />have - had</span>\t\t"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Irregular verbs have different endings. <br /><br /><span class=\"italic\">Example:<br />see -- saw<br />take - took<br />have - had</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Forms</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I worked from 9 - 11 p.m. <br />I saw a movie from 9 - 11 p.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I didn't walk to school. <br />I didn't drive to work.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Information question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What did you cook?<br /> What did you do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes / No question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you cook chicken?<br /> Did you do your homework?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Let's Review Verbs with Infinitives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Some verbs are followed by verbs in the Infinitive (to + verb) form.<br /> <br />Some verbs are: <br />prefer<br /> want<br /> need<br /> like"}, {"type": "example", "content": "John likes to eat popcorn when he watches movies. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She needs to leave early. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I really want to go to the game, but I don't like to play in bad weather."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "horror film "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a scary movie with frightening characters"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to watch horror films."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " gore"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "another word for horror or scary films"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really like gore."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scary   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "frightening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to watch scary movies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "action movies "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "movies with many fight scenes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer to watch action films."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "show "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a film or theatre performance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What show do you want to see?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "matin\u00e9e   "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a movie show organized in the daytime, usually in the afternoon"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's see a matin\u00e9e."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "special "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "organized or arranged for a particular event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's have the popcorn special."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a movie (an English one is best)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Watch it and write 6-8 sentences about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share the information with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I report about events in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express intentions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express my opinion in 6-8 sentences about a movie."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my ideas with a partner about movies."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le03ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le03ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi, John? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">John</span>: Hey, Sally. What's up?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span